1
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,490
Lambda.

2
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:16,670
It's you two.

3
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:20,380
If you're here, that means this is all 
the reinforcements we're getting?

4
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:24,210
Not quite. I'm heading straight back 
to organize the next batch.

5
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:27,710
There was just something I wanted 
to confirm first with the people on-site.

6
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:29,090
And that is?

7
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,550
About Number 666.

8
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:32,750
Princess Rose Oriana?

9
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:35,290
I heard she took it upon herself 
to join the enemy.

10
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:37,900
It was a perfect storm 
of unfavorable conditions.

11
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:41,110
It may be a little harsh 
to call what she did a "betrayal".

12
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:46,500
I see, but the fact remains that her insubordination 
put her teammates in danger.

13
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:48,880
I was that girl's instructor.

14
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:54,120
If the organization is to render judgment on her, 
then the least I can do is carry it out myself.

15
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,300
Unfortunately, that won't be possible.

16
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:59,370
Not even the Seven Shades have authority 
over this matter anymore.

17
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:01,340
What are you talking about?

18
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:02,380
You don't mean...

19
00:01:03,010 --> 00:01:05,460
Our fearless leader, Lord Shadow himself?

20
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:10,170
He has rendered merciless judgment 
on all who have stood against us.

21
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:12,140
Neither power nor authority...

22
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:14,600
It's all meaningless before him.

23
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,100
I agree that the princess's behavior 
was problematic,

24
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,600
but that's just too...

25
00:01:20,090 --> 00:01:21,350
No...

26
00:01:21,570 --> 00:01:25,600
No one in the world could ever defy 
his magnificent will.

27
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:28,990
I have no doubt the princess 
will meet a fitting end.

28
00:01:32,670 --> 00:01:36,990
Is there no longer anything we can do?

