920
00:03:13,460 --> 00:03:16,340
It's all because of that 
father-murdering princess.

921
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:19,000
Prices have gone up 
and my ma's cooking tastes like crap,

922
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,960
all 'cause of that damn princess.

923
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,410
She really needs to pay.

924
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:24,600
"Rose Oriana...

925
00:03:25,230 --> 00:03:27,630
I adamantly oppose your marriage!"

926
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:29,300
That's a good line.

927
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:32,500
But it's broad daylight, 
so appearing from the sky isn't exactly...

928
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,900
This calls for a quick hop over the gate.

929
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:39,000
Now is the time for my 
polished teleportation skills to shine.

930
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,810
So onward, toâ

931
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:40,590
Lord Shadow!

932
00:03:40,590 --> 00:03:41,910
I mean, Cid!

933
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:43,890
It's good to see you again!

934
00:03:44,250 --> 00:03:46,550
Epsilon, what a coincidence.

935
00:03:46,550 --> 00:03:47,830
I know, right?

936
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:50,130
Are you here about the problem?

937
00:03:50,130 --> 00:03:52,130
Yes, the problem.

938
00:03:52,130 --> 00:03:54,450
You arrived at just the right time, Epsilon.

939
00:03:54,450 --> 00:03:55,880
You flatter me!

940
00:03:55,880 --> 00:04:01,460
Surely you granted me these powers because you 
knew you would need them at exactly for this moment.

941
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:06,310
In this country, they respect anyone whose art 
warrants it, regardless of race or rank.

942
00:04:06,700 --> 00:04:10,520
That's why I'm allowed to walk right 
into the royal palace whenever I want to.

943
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:14,700
And why I, your "number one student", 
am allowed to accompany you.

944
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:16,210
I do apologize for that.

945
00:04:16,210 --> 00:04:20,620
We both know that you, my Lord, 
taught me everything I know about the piano.

946
00:04:20,910 --> 00:04:23,500
<i>Slime content: 99%.</i>

947
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:28,020
<i>She's constantly adjusting it with intricate magic control 
to make it move with her center of gravity.</i>

948
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:32,590
<i>Even incorporating chaos theory 
into this excessively excess-avoidant excess of effort.</i><i></i>

949
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,540
Is something on your mind?

950
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,290
I guess I'm thinking about 
the fruit of all your efforts.

951
00:04:37,290 --> 00:04:38,500
Oh, stop!

952
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:40,180
I still have so much to learn!

953
00:04:40,670 --> 00:04:43,430
We're keeping an eye on the target 
while letting her roam free.

954
00:04:43,750 --> 00:04:46,140
None of our spies have been discovered.

955
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,840
We're waiting for the moment toâ

956
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,800
Well, if it isn't Miss Shiron.

957
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:53,290
Oh, Duke Perv Asshat...

958
00:04:53,290 --> 00:04:56,940
Were you scheduled to perform for us 
at our luncheon today?

959
00:04:57,300 --> 00:04:59,000
Yes, Your Grace.

960
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:02,090
I'm planning to debut a brand new piece.

961
00:05:02,090 --> 00:05:03,710
I look forward to hearing it.

962
00:05:03,710 --> 00:05:08,630
Every one of your compositions is ahead of its time 
and a definite delight to listen to.

963
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:12,400
I only hope my music can bring 
some solace to Princess Rose,

964
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:14,960
now that she's lost 
His Royal Majesty, her father.

965
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:17,290
I appreciate your concern.

966
00:05:17,290 --> 00:05:19,450
But I must apologize.

967
00:05:19,450 --> 00:05:24,130
Rose is not feeling well today 
and is unlikely to attend the luncheon.

968
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:25,720
Oh, my...

969
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:28,310
Then, as her fiancÃ©, 
you must be very worried about her.

970
00:05:28,590 --> 00:05:32,910
That's all right. It is a husband's duty 
to support the kingdom in his wife's place.

971
00:05:32,540 --> 00:05:34,770
<i>Duke Perv Asshat...</i>

972
00:05:32,910 --> 00:05:34,770
You're so strong, Duke Asshat.

973
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:39,250
<i>Just one look and you can tell he lives his entire life 
inside the typical evil aristocrat mold.</i><i></i>

974
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:42,090
<i>I guess if you can't just 
naturally master that mold,</i>

975
00:05:42,090 --> 00:05:44,660
<i>the road to being 
a named character must be rough.</i>

976
00:05:44,660 --> 00:05:46,910
Might I ask who this young man is?

977
00:05:47,410 --> 00:05:53,900
My grand, my sublime, 
my one and only favorite pupil.

978
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:56,110
A student, Miss Shiron?

979
00:05:56,110 --> 00:05:58,000
I had no idea you took on apprentices.

980
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,880
We have a secret relationship.

981
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:03,840
Forgive me for asking this, 
but does he have a pass to enter the palace?

982
00:06:04,090 --> 00:06:08,090
I thought if I brought him as my guest, 
there wouldn't be a problem.

983
00:06:08,090 --> 00:06:11,560
My deepest apologies, 
but we've had to change protocol.

984
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:14,690
Oh, dear. In that case, 
should we come back another day?

985
00:06:14,690 --> 00:06:17,100
No, there will be no need for that.

986
00:06:17,790 --> 00:06:21,130
We'd like to ask for the boy 
to play a piece for us.

987
00:06:21,130 --> 00:06:25,620
It seems we're all beside ourselves with curiosity 
over how skilled your apprentice is.

988
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:27,500
<i>An abrupt, unreasonable demand.</i><i></i>

989
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:30,960
<i>He's got a cookie-cutter villain style 
that doesn't let up even on background characters.</i><i></i>

990
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:32,830
<i>That's the spirit.</i>

991
00:06:33,110 --> 00:06:37,250
<i>Then, I'll respond as the type 
who's kinda good at the piano.</i><i></i>

992
00:06:37,250 --> 00:06:41,090
Miss Shiron is, without a doubt, 
the best pianist in the world.

993
00:06:41,090 --> 00:06:43,250
To think she had an apprentice.

994
00:06:43,250 --> 00:06:47,470
It would be cruel to expect too much of him, 
but this should be an entertaining diversion.

995
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:50,180
<i>The regular citizens 
are all so jaded and bitter,</i>

996
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:52,890
<i>but the nobility are living their best lives 
in the lap of luxury.</i>

997
00:06:52,890 --> 00:06:55,900
I will exact vengeance 
for the blood tax you are owed.

998
00:07:16,790 --> 00:07:18,380
My, my...

999
00:07:19,170 --> 00:07:20,590
Beautiful...

1000
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:26,810
Magnificent!

1001
00:07:26,810 --> 00:07:30,220
I can see the moonlight 
streaming down on us from above.

1002
00:07:45,790 --> 00:07:48,340
It's so moving, I'm crying a flood of tears!

1003
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:51,170
We have witnessed the true, 
divine essence of the "Moonlight Sonata".

1004
00:07:51,170 --> 00:07:55,290
I, and the audience, will remember this moment 
for the rest of our humble lives!

1005
00:07:55,650 --> 00:07:59,500
O, young musical genius, 
might I be so bold as to ask your name?

1006
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:01,670
Oh, I'm...

1007
00:08:01,670 --> 00:08:04,090
He's still in the middle of his education.

1008
00:08:04,090 --> 00:08:06,630
He'll be formally introduced 
once he's completed his training.

1009
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:10,380
But we're all dying to know more about him.

1010
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:12,130
Anyone here would love to be his patron.

1011
00:08:12,130 --> 00:08:14,350
It's too soon to consider any of that.

1012
00:08:14,350 --> 00:08:18,310
He will set foot 
on the public stage, all in good time.

1013
00:08:18,700 --> 00:08:22,270
And when the day arrives, 
I'm sure the entire world will know his name.

1014
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:24,690
When that happens, 
I do hope you'll come talk to me.

1015
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:27,710
I will spare no effort to prepare the most fitting setting 
for the start of this new legend!

1016
00:08:27,710 --> 00:08:28,750
Nor will I!

1017
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:29,960
Please, let me help!

1018
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:30,990
No, allow me!

1019
00:08:35,290 --> 00:08:36,520
Master Shiron.

1020
00:08:37,010 --> 00:08:40,880
While I'm here, I would like to take a look around 
and see more of the palace.

1021
00:08:42,130 --> 00:08:44,110
Yes, "while you're here."

1022
00:08:44,110 --> 00:08:45,710
This may be an excellent opportunity.

1023
00:08:45,710 --> 00:08:47,720
In that case, allow me to show you around!

1024
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,250
No, I can go by myselfâ

1025
00:08:49,250 --> 00:08:52,400
I could never be so rude 
as to neglect you like that!

1026
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:53,290
It's all rightâ

1027
00:08:53,290 --> 00:08:55,850
My name's Margaret, the maid.

1028
00:08:55,850 --> 00:08:58,500
I also happen to be entrusted with 
the care of Princess Rose,

1029
00:08:58,500 --> 00:09:00,610
so I know all about the palace.

1030
00:09:00,610 --> 00:09:01,630
You care for Rose?

1031
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:03,300
This is your first time in the palace, no?

1032
00:09:03,300 --> 00:09:06,410
Then, I can show you all the best places!

1033
00:09:06,410 --> 00:09:07,690
Oh... Huh?

1034
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:11,040
Excuse me, miss! Would you kindly stopâ

1035
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,400
Slime content...

1036
00:09:13,610 --> 00:09:14,910
Zero percent, huh?

1037
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:20,490
It is winter, isn't it?

1038
00:09:20,490 --> 00:09:24,210
There's an artifact underground 
that keeps the temperature constant.

1039
00:09:24,210 --> 00:09:25,590
Really?

1040
00:09:25,590 --> 00:09:29,210
You know, I was so touched 
by your performance earlier!

1041
00:09:29,210 --> 00:09:32,340
Knowing you, I'm sure you'll be 
a top-class pianist in no time!

1042
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:35,640
That was more wonderful 
than any performance I've heard in my life!

1043
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:41,640
<i>It's because the performance techniques in this world 
are pretty underdeveloped compared to modern Japan.</i><i></i>

1044
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:46,210
I happened to overhear that 
Earl Patron himself has his eye on you.

1045
00:09:46,210 --> 00:09:48,210
If you become his personal pianist,

1046
00:09:48,210 --> 00:09:50,460
you're guaranteed at least 
a hundred million zeni a year.

1047
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:51,450
A hundred million zeni?!

1048
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,790
And they do annual salaries here?

1049
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:56,480
Marquis Newwealth spoke 
very highly of you, as well.

1050
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:59,120
Your salary would drop to seventy million,

1051
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,210
but he has a broad network of connections,

1052
00:10:01,210 --> 00:10:03,960
so if you're looking for fame, 
you should go with the Marquis.

1053
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:06,400
<i>The future musician route, huh?</i><i></i>

1054
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:09,730
<i>If I get a yearly salary, 
I won't have to count on handouts for every gig.</i>

1055
00:10:09,730 --> 00:10:10,920
<i>That might actually work.</i>

1056
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:13,430
And I also recommend my own family.

1057
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:14,610
Your family?

1058
00:10:14,610 --> 00:10:17,340
Our starting pay for musicians 
is fifty million,

1059
00:10:17,340 --> 00:10:20,910
but I can talk to my father 
and convince him to give you seventy.

1060
00:10:20,910 --> 00:10:22,060
You can do that?

1061
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:23,880
Just between you and me,

1062
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:28,900
I happen to be on very good terms 
with both Earl Patron and Marquis Newwealth.

1063
00:10:28,900 --> 00:10:31,610
I can work it all out 
if you let me handle everything.

1064
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:34,450
Yeah, but Master Shiron wouldn't...

1065
00:10:34,450 --> 00:10:38,580
Lady Shiron only wants to keep 
her darling little apprentice to herself.

1066
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:42,020
Don't worry about it, 
and just leave it all to me, all right?

1067
00:10:42,020 --> 00:10:44,130
I will do everything in my power 
to support you.

1068
00:10:44,130 --> 00:10:44,790
Huh?

1069
00:10:44,790 --> 00:10:47,590
Come to think of it, 
you're Princess Rose's maid, right?

1070
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,610
Where is she now?

1071
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:55,090
You're interested 
in Princess Rose, Mr. Apprentice?

1072
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:58,050
Personally, I detest that woman.

1073
00:10:58,550 --> 00:11:04,020
I was her personal maid, 
even before she left to study in the Midgar Kingdom.

1074
00:11:04,540 --> 00:11:09,700
She was a little strange, 
taking an interest in barbaric arts like fencing.

1075
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:12,200
But she was kind and intelligent.

1076
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,990
Everyone loved our Princess Rose.

1077
00:11:15,290 --> 00:11:15,950
But...

1078
00:11:20,310 --> 00:11:23,500
Our kingdom is in shambles now, 
and it's all her fault.

1079
00:11:24,460 --> 00:11:27,960
So, Mr. Apprentice, would you like to know 
where you can find Princess Rose now?

1080
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,590
Yeah, kinda.

1081
00:11:29,590 --> 00:11:31,130
Well...

1082
00:11:31,130 --> 00:11:32,710
that's a secret.

1083
00:11:32,710 --> 00:11:35,150
You certainly can't expect me to tell you.

1084
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:36,180
Oh, okay.

1085
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:38,000
But...

1086
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,210
But, well...

1087
00:11:39,210 --> 00:11:40,510
Maybe just a little hint.

1088
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:45,000
I'll make an exception 
just for you, all right?

1089
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:44,170
<i>I thought I'd scared her off, 
but she's already back and showing sympathy.</i>

1090
00:11:44,170 --> 00:11:45,890
<i>And her vulnerable side, too.</i><i></i>

1091
00:11:46,210 --> 00:11:48,270
So please, don't tell anyone.

1092
00:11:46,210 --> 00:11:47,790
<i>I know what this is.</i>

1093
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:48,980
<i>She's trying to convert me to her religion.</i>

1094
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:52,940
Princess Rose has been locked up 
at the top of the west tower.

1095
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:56,000
It will be our special secret, 
just between us!

1096
00:11:53,210 --> 00:11:55,250
She's definitely Rose's maid,

1097
00:11:55,250 --> 00:11:57,290
with the same proselytizing techniques.

1098
00:11:57,290 --> 00:11:58,410
Hey.

1099
00:11:59,010 --> 00:12:01,370
What are you doing, sneaking around here?

1100
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,130
Who are you?

1101
00:12:03,130 --> 00:12:05,410
What? Can't you tell?

1102
00:12:05,410 --> 00:12:07,100
I'm a castle guard!

1103
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:10,750
Is that too hard 
for the great musician to figure out?

1104
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:17,710
We Dark Knights get the same treatment as any ordinary soldier, 
while people like you are sitting pretty.

1105
00:12:17,710 --> 00:12:18,920
I'm sorry?

1106
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:20,500
Don't look down on us, jerk.

1107
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:22,800
We're the ones keeping the kingdom safe.

1108
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:26,310
You can call us barbarians, 
but we're risking our lives here!

1109
00:12:26,310 --> 00:12:29,830
While you're just kicking back and enjoying attention 
from all the women in the palace!

1110
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:30,600
I'm sorry?

1111
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:34,020
Don't just stand there grinning. Fight me!

1112
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:37,510
See if you can defeat the barbaric Dark Knight 
with that music you're so proud of.

1113
00:12:37,510 --> 00:12:38,200
I'm sorry?

1114
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:42,000
You're pathetic, 
practically shaking in your boots!

1115
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,790
Musician, my ass! 
The arts are a load of garbage!

1116
00:12:44,790 --> 00:12:45,410
I'm sorry?

1117
00:12:45,410 --> 00:12:48,940
Now that you know your place, 
I expect you to never get near her again!

1118
00:12:48,940 --> 00:12:52,800
My sweet little Maggie and I 
are deeply in love, okay?!

1119
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,750
I'm so... What?

1120
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:58,720
Every single day, we come to this garden 
to reaffirm our love for each other.

1121
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:02,930
I gaze at her, and my dear Meg Muffin 
turns to see me...

1122
00:13:02,930 --> 00:13:05,020
But she's such a bashful little thing.

1123
00:13:05,020 --> 00:13:07,420
Her cheeks flush red, 
and she scampers away from me.

1124
00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:08,630
Isn't it adorable?

1125
00:13:09,500 --> 00:13:11,960
But that's all either of us really needs.

1126
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,100
Do you understand?

1127
00:13:13,100 --> 00:13:16,210
We know how each other feels, 
from a single glance from afar.

1128
00:13:17,030 --> 00:13:19,500
Oh, my Margie-Wargie!

1129
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:23,490
We haven't spoken a word to each other, 
but your love is coming through loud and clear!

1130
00:13:23,670 --> 00:13:26,400
I know love comes in all shapes and sizes,

1131
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:28,540
You must have been frightened 
by the approach of a real man!

1132
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:30,080
but the fact that he doesn't 
see anything questionable in her reactions...

1133
00:13:28,540 --> 00:13:30,080
I will go right now to comfort you!

1134
00:13:30,630 --> 00:13:32,790
Me! I will comf...

1135
00:13:30,630 --> 00:13:33,200
I always knew religion was scary.

1136
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:34,960


1137
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:39,710
I managed to protect my mother,

1138
00:13:39,710 --> 00:13:41,540
but the kingdom...

1139
00:13:41,540 --> 00:13:43,220
Shadow Garden is on the move.

1140
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:48,100
Now that I've turned traitor, 
they won't give me a second thought.

1141
00:13:48,430 --> 00:13:50,800
And then, there's the Cult of Diablos.

1142
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:52,210
Someday soon,

1143
00:13:52,210 --> 00:13:55,710
my kingdom will be the stage 
for a clash between the two organizations.

1144
00:13:56,230 --> 00:13:58,800
But as I am now...

1145
00:14:05,780 --> 00:14:08,160
That sure wasn't 
an easy climb without magic.

1146
00:14:07,290 --> 00:14:08,600
Cid!

1147
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:09,450
Oh, Rose...

1148
00:14:10,700 --> 00:14:13,000
Cid... Cid...

1149
00:14:13,500 --> 00:14:14,670
How I've longed to see you!

1150
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:17,920
Me, too, Rose.

1151
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,510
I had to see you, no matter what.

1152
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:22,310
There's something I've wanted to tell you.

1153
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,200
That's no reason to...

1154
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:28,900
But how in the world did you get here?

1155
00:14:28,900 --> 00:14:31,930
I snuck in as the apprentice 
of a pianist friend of mine.

1156
00:14:31,930 --> 00:14:34,400
You did that for me?

1157
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:37,360
I want to talk to you about your marriage.

1158
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:40,320
There's nothing to talk about!

1159
00:14:40,790 --> 00:14:42,280
It's not true, is it?

1160
00:14:42,590 --> 00:14:44,110
But it is.

1161
00:14:44,540 --> 00:14:47,600
I will be marrying Duke Perv Asshat.

1162
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,240
Lies!

1163
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:50,900
You must remember! Think back to that day!

1164
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:53,710
You told me that, come what may, 
you would be a tyrâ

1165
00:14:53,710 --> 00:14:54,580
Cid!

1166
00:14:55,310 --> 00:14:56,880
Please...

1167
00:14:56,880 --> 00:14:58,800
don't bring up that day.

1168
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:00,590
Don't think about me.

1169
00:15:00,590 --> 00:15:02,300
Forget I even exist.

1170
00:15:02,300 --> 00:15:03,600
Rose...

1171
00:15:05,250 --> 00:15:05,840
I can't.

1172
00:15:06,830 --> 00:15:08,710
After all, we're the same.

1173
00:15:09,810 --> 00:15:12,670
Rose, you grew up in a kingdom 
that looks down on fencers,

1174
00:15:12,670 --> 00:15:14,590
but you decided to be a Dark Knight.

1175
00:15:14,590 --> 00:15:17,400
Your peers rejected you. 
They never understood you.

1176
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,960
You were alone.

1177
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:22,130
But you stayed true 
to your chosen way of life.

1178
00:15:22,130 --> 00:15:23,570
I'm the same.

1179
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:25,530
You're like me?

1180
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:29,240
No one understood my dream, either.

1181
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:32,950
So, I think I know better than anyone 
how you've felt.

1182
00:15:32,950 --> 00:15:34,210
Cid...

1183
00:15:34,790 --> 00:15:36,120
Your dream...

1184
00:15:40,790 --> 00:15:42,050
I...

1185
00:15:42,050 --> 00:15:44,800
I will understand your dream.

1186
00:15:45,390 --> 00:15:48,800
Even if the whole world 
should reject you, I will always...

1187
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:52,170
But the world doesn't agree.

1188
00:15:52,170 --> 00:15:53,590
"Are you stupid?" they say.

1189
00:15:53,590 --> 00:15:55,210
"Is something wrong with you?" they say.

1190
00:15:55,210 --> 00:15:57,230
"Would you grow up already?" they say.

1191
00:15:57,230 --> 00:15:59,390
I don't care about any of that!

1192
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:02,460
Your dream is 
the most precious thing there is!

1193
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:03,690
Rose...

1194
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:07,750
We tried to stay true 
to our chosen ways of life.

1195
00:16:07,750 --> 00:16:11,530
No matter the obstacles and rejections we faced, 
we stayed true to ourselves.

1196
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:12,990
But right now, Rose,

1197
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,920
you are perverting that way of life.

1198
00:16:15,450 --> 00:16:16,920
P-Perverting? No!

1199
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:19,800
You stabbed your fiancÃ© 
and killed your own father!

1200
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,210
I won't ask you why,

1201
00:16:22,210 --> 00:16:27,630
because I believe you did it out of your own convictions 
to stay true to the path you took.

1202
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:31,480
But why, after all that, 
are you doing something to pervert it now?

1203
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:32,510
I...

1204
00:16:32,920 --> 00:16:35,130
Marrying the fiancÃ© you once stabbed

1205
00:16:35,130 --> 00:16:37,480
is tantamount 
to perverting your way of life!

1206
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,790
But you've been true to it all this time!

1207
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:42,690
So, why would you give that up now?!

1208
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:48,110
I have nothing left to tell you.

1209
00:16:49,510 --> 00:16:52,620
Please, forget about me, 
and find your own happiness.

1210
00:16:52,620 --> 00:16:53,840
I can't!

1211
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:55,040
Rose, I need youâ

1212
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:58,610
That is my one and only wish.

1213
00:17:02,290 --> 00:17:05,000
I received a report 
that you had met with a visitor.

1214
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:07,500
Does it look like I have a visitor?

1215
00:17:10,420 --> 00:17:12,110
It seems you've been crying.

1216
00:17:16,390 --> 00:17:18,350
Would you kindly refrain from touching meâ

1217
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:20,540
Your attitude needs improvement.

1218
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:22,350
We will soon be husband and wife.

1219
00:17:22,350 --> 00:17:25,400
We'll be married... in name only...

1220
00:17:26,210 --> 00:17:28,900
You will mind your tongue.

1221
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:33,370
Don't forget that Queen Reina's life 
depends on your affability.

1222
00:17:36,210 --> 00:17:37,660
Yes... sir.

1223
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:39,090
That's better.

1224
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:43,000
Come, we have a wedding to plan.

1225
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:44,630
Yes, sir.

1226
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:46,500
I see what's happening.

1227
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:49,200
I'm just gonna have to switch to Plan B.

1228
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:54,800
Still, I wonder if this was supposed 
to be the wedding ring or something?

1229
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:57,900
Maybe I shouldn't have 
taken it from Mr. Pervert.

1230
00:18:02,630 --> 00:18:03,920
I believe this is a first?

1231
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:05,860
For you to fail a mission.

1232
00:18:06,090 --> 00:18:07,630
My deepest apologies.

1233
00:18:07,630 --> 00:18:10,110
I will dispose of Number 666 
as quickly as possible.

1234
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:12,700
Her actions were thoughtless and hasty,

1235
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:15,170
but I suspect it's too soon 
to declare her a traitor just yet.

1236
00:18:15,170 --> 00:18:16,500
But...

1237
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:19,250
Your loyalty is quite admirable.

1238
00:18:19,250 --> 00:18:21,120
But it is possible to take it too far.

1239
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:25,500
I intend to eventually promote you 
to a position directly below the Seven Shades.

1240
00:18:25,710 --> 00:18:27,590
Do not disappoint me.

1241
00:18:27,590 --> 00:18:28,410
I understand.

1242
00:18:29,210 --> 00:18:32,630
Besides, this failure was not your fault.

1243
00:18:32,630 --> 00:18:37,010
This is our responsibility for not telling 
Princess Rose about her mother.

1244
00:18:37,610 --> 00:18:41,500
We had no idea they would bring 
Queen Reina to the First Ruins.

1245
00:18:41,500 --> 00:18:45,380
It was the Seven Shades' mistake 
that put the two of them in the same place.

1246
00:18:45,380 --> 00:18:46,860
You couldn't have...

1247
00:18:47,210 --> 00:18:49,630
We never meant to lie to her about it,

1248
00:18:49,630 --> 00:18:51,820
but we hoped she would never find out.

1249
00:18:52,210 --> 00:18:55,210
But Lord Shadow has taken over 
this case, as you know.

1250
00:18:55,210 --> 00:18:56,380
Yes.

1251
00:18:56,380 --> 00:18:59,300
He made contact with her today...

1252
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:02,210
but he did not punish her.

1253
00:19:02,810 --> 00:19:04,880
Either there's something he's after,

1254
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:06,500
he's waiting to see what she does,

1255
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:08,890
or there's some even deeper purpose.

1256
00:19:09,380 --> 00:19:11,400
It's beyond our understanding.

1257
00:19:11,950 --> 00:19:15,010
There is a view of the world 
that only he can see.

1258
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:19,970
It must be a very lonely view.

1259
00:19:20,590 --> 00:19:24,380
We will trust Lord Shadow's judgment 
in the matter of Number 666.

1260
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:25,300
Very well.

1261
00:19:25,300 --> 00:19:28,400
The problem is the ring 
they found at the ruins.

1262
00:19:29,210 --> 00:19:33,040
If we put undue pressure on them, 
they might use the key.

1263
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:35,490
And if the legends are true, 
the kingdom will...

1264
00:19:35,790 --> 00:19:38,800
Is the Black Rose truly that dangerous?

1265
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:41,840
Once, when the Oriana Kingdom 
was threatened with annihilation,

1266
00:19:41,840 --> 00:19:47,210
they used it to wipe out a hundred thousand Velgaltan troops 
that were bearing down on the royal capital in a single night.

1267
00:19:47,210 --> 00:19:49,200
That story is more than just a fairy tale.

1268
00:19:49,590 --> 00:19:53,290
But this time, the power will be used 
to destroy the Oriana Kingdom.

1269
00:19:53,290 --> 00:19:54,710
We must work carefully.

1270
00:19:54,710 --> 00:19:56,130
First, we find the exact location 
of the keyâ

1271
00:19:56,130 --> 00:19:58,220
Ah, that was nice!

1272
00:19:58,220 --> 00:20:00,610
I sure love big bathtubs!

1273
00:20:01,050 --> 00:20:02,960
That's my girl, Epsilon!

1274
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:05,430
We both know coffee milk is 
the best thing after a bath.

1275
00:20:05,430 --> 00:20:06,990
It's an honor!

1276
00:20:09,490 --> 00:20:12,900
Please, come this way 
and I'll massage your shoulders.

1277
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:14,320
This brings back memories.

1278
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:17,950
I remember when Eta said she was testing 
a new mechanical massager,

1279
00:20:17,950 --> 00:20:20,170
and she made Beta scream.

1280
00:20:20,170 --> 00:20:23,490
Those were the days 
when we could be together every day.

1281
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:28,700
I hope you can relax and enjoy this precious moment 
just as if you were back in old times.

1282
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:34,090
<i>Even when he's undercover as 
an average half-wit student, he's a vision of magnificence.</i><i></i>

1283
00:20:34,090 --> 00:20:36,090
Oh, yeah. About that "thing"...

1284
00:20:36,090 --> 00:20:38,000
Looks like it'll be taken care of 
sooner than expected.

1285
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:41,070
It's only your first day undercover, 
and you've already...

1286
00:20:41,070 --> 00:20:41,910
Yup.

1287
00:20:41,910 --> 00:20:44,140
As far as that goes, 
it's practically already over.

1288
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:46,320
You handled it so easily!

1289
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:50,480
Yeah, I can knock out something like that 
with my little finger.

1290
00:20:50,480 --> 00:20:54,200
You're amazing, Lord Shadow!

1291
00:20:55,630 --> 00:20:59,110
How is your progress, Perv Asshat?

1292
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:03,580
The project is moving along 
without a single hitch, Sir Mordred.

1293
00:21:03,580 --> 00:21:05,490
The Black Rose...

1294
00:21:05,490 --> 00:21:07,580
If we can take back its power,

1295
00:21:07,580 --> 00:21:11,460
our authority within the Cult 
will be unshakable.

1296
00:21:11,460 --> 00:21:14,310
But it seems there are some rats 
sniffing around.

1297
00:21:14,310 --> 00:21:15,420
Don't get careless.

1298
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:16,840
No need to worry.

1299
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:20,380
The Ring of Succession 
never leaves my person.

1300
00:21:20,670 --> 00:21:22,000
Good to hear.

1301
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:26,880
When the sun rises on our success, then you, too, 
will be granted a seat in the Rounds.

1302
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:29,360
But you are not married to the princess yet.

1303
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:32,000
Make no mistakes, Perv Asshat.

1304
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:32,610
Yes, sir.

1305
00:21:36,610 --> 00:21:38,100
Senile fool...

1306
00:21:38,580 --> 00:21:42,420
The key, Princess Rose, the kingdom...

1307
00:21:42,420 --> 00:21:44,370
They're all here in my hands.

1308
00:21:45,670 --> 00:21:49,160
What will you do about it, Shadow Garden?

1309
00:21:49,390 --> 00:21:51,040
Oh, Perv, where are you?

1310
00:21:51,590 --> 00:21:52,890
Perv!

1311
00:21:56,300 --> 00:21:57,680
Honestly...

1312
00:21:58,310 --> 00:22:00,510
Women are so incorrigible.

1313
00:22:04,890 --> 00:22:06,840
Oh, Perv!

1314
00:22:06,840 --> 00:22:08,500
I was so lonely!

